# MD_Parola scrolls "ORBE" across all four chained MAX7219 modules over hardware SPI.
open
expect @matrix off
# The sketch starts 66 ms after power-on, when the start from reset the fuses set is over.
step 366ms
expect @matrix lit
expect @matrix shows tests/scroll_1.screen
step 300ms
expect @matrix shows tests/scroll_2.screen
expect @matrix.brightness > 1mA
expect @matrix.brightness < 3mA
expect no diagnostics
